WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.100
Through the palace doors, the path becomes a climb: shattered halls, winding stairs, a gallery of empty crowns.

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.200
Beyond the final doorway waits the throne room.

3
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:24.500
The adviser sits beneath the stolen Crown of Balance. He offers you a place beside him.

4
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:32.600
“Why solve a difficult world,” he asks, “when you can make it obey?”

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
You open your spellbook.

6
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.400
Act VI: The Throne · Levels 51–60
